WEBVTT

00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:04.580
I'm Yuna. Your brand directs the poses so

00:00:04.580 --> 00:00:06.980
shoppers can see themselves styled like your models.

00:00:08.120 --> 00:00:11.100
Begin front-facing, then choose poses for each

00:00:11.100 --> 00:00:14.820
garment, folded arms for a leather jacket, or

00:00:14.820 --> 00:00:16.380
a hand on the hip for a knit

00:00:16.380 --> 00:00:25.020
polo. Your creative direction shapes every look. Finish

00:00:25.020 --> 00:00:28.220
with a simulated back view. Unseen details are

00:00:28.220 --> 00:00:28.780
illustrated.
